# Database Tasks & Improvements

## Priority Tasks

### 1. Add Username to Users Table
- [ ] Update users table schema to store `username` field
- [ ] Update server actions to fetch and store username from Farcaster context
- [ ] Migration script to backfill existing users with usernames

### 2. Create Emojis Table
- [ ] Create `emojis` table with the following fields:
  - `id` (UUID, primary key)
  - `emoji` (text, the actual emoji character)
  - `name` (text, human-readable name like "Happy", "Growth")
  - `keywords` (text array, searchable keywords)
  - `category` (text, grouping like "faces", "nature", "objects")
  - `image_filename` (text, filename for the emoji asset)
  - `hex_code` (text, unicode hex representation)
  - `created_at` (timestamp)
  - `is_active` (boolean, for enabling/disabling emojis)

### 3. Update Voting System
- [ ] Modify votes table to reference emoji by ID instead of raw emoji character
- [ ] Add foreign key constraint between votes.emoji_id and emojis.id
- [ ] Update server actions to use emoji IDs
- [ ] Migration script to convert existing emoji characters to IDs

### 4. Row Level Security (RLS)
- [ ] Enable RLS on all tables
- [ ] Create policies for `users` table:
  - Users can read their own record
  - Users can update their own record
  - System can create new users during authentication
- [ ] Create policies for `votes` table:
  - Users can insert their own votes (one per day)
  - Users can read all votes (for results)
  - Users cannot update or delete votes
- [ ] Create policies for `emojis` table:
  - Everyone can read active emojis
  - Only system can modify emojis
- [ ] Create policies for `daily_results` table:
  - Everyone can read finalized results
  - Only system can create/update results

