## Implementation Notes

### Server Key vs Anonymous Key
- ✅ Server actions can safely use the service role key
- ✅ Server actions run on the server, not exposed to clients
- ✅ RLS policies will still apply for client-side operations
- ✅ Use anonymous key for any client-side Supabase operations

### Migration Strategy
1. Create new tables without breaking existing functionality
2. Add new fields to existing tables with default values
3. Backfill data using server actions
4. Update application code to use new schema
5. Remove deprecated fields after confirming stability

